{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0204_1000_040tam", "source_sha256": "894531fd64f19ade5ad7507e8738a05cdc2c25ebea9bd81445cd745330476bf1", "ja": "あっ、おやぶーん！\n新しい衣装、着てみたぞ～っ！", "zh": "啊，老大！\n我试穿了新服装哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0204_1001_p", "source_sha256": "649b843c585734ff01d351650e028316010aa480f1c1510f6ffe7e7a518ff11b", "ja": "お、似合ってるじゃないか。\nイメージした通り、環にピッタリの衣装だったな。", "zh": "哦，很合适嘛。\n就像想象中那样，是非常适合小环的服装呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0204_1002_040tam", "source_sha256": "e7709054f6ab0c91ec3c2f4d058e533d9ff92f36f350168d5c3da80e45b6e46e", "ja": "くふふ、おやぶんにほめられた♪\nありがとう、おやぶんっ！", "zh": "嘿嘿，被大将夸奖了♪  \n谢谢你，大将！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0204_1003_040tam", "source_sha256": "bbf4c7c7f15cfc865c028c804da24df752fe09e2042307ea979b5ef517293bff", "ja": "あのね、たまきこの服好き！　船に乗る人みたい。\n脚に布がついてて、面白いぞ～♪", "zh": "那个，环喜欢这件衣服！看起来像是要乘船的人。\n腿上还带着布条，真有意思呀～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0204_1004_040tam", "source_sha256": "e197ca59fbe8b1d0e8d23c8e10b61bc5f0925a8819cf3cfa45a58a7a2cb5f709", "ja": "それからこの髪飾り、うみみとお揃いなんだって！\nすっごくカワイイぞ～♪", "zh": "还有这个发饰，听说和海美的是同款哦！\n超级可爱的～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0204_1005_p", "source_sha256": "598bc12dff1dd570f709dfe8e14d3409bd7e98ef665c16a85b1509cfe0d157f5", "ja": "そうだな、同じコンセプトの衣装だから。\n喜んでもらえたみたいでなによりだよ。", "zh": "是啊，毕竟是同一个概念的服装。\n看起来你很喜欢，我就放心了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0204_1006_040tam", "source_sha256": "29598dae58c9bfd806809305ed4055a60a7f9d2c6d8f750837e0e9e89b21752d", "ja": "くふふ♪　あっ、ねえねえ！\nみさきが言ってたけど、この衣装って水着の衣装なの？", "zh": "咕嘿嘿♪　啊，对了对了！\n听美咲说，这套服装是泳装吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0204_1007_p", "source_sha256": "1f28c9a0df39cd40b62c910b358346c26e6c93f2288ed818337345f017e314e6", "ja": "そうだよ。仕事で海に入ったりするから、\n濡れてもいいように水着みたいになっているんだ。", "zh": "是啊。因为工作时会下海，所以做成了泳装的样式，这样就算弄湿了也没关系。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0204_1008_040tam", "source_sha256": "0de8011a83bc63e1e6d3a795fbcada2a3012ad5c9fceec79b045e05058b096e3", "ja": "そうなんだ～！\nでもなんか、学校で着てる水着と全然違うね。", "zh": "原来是这样～！\n不过总觉得，和学校里穿的泳衣完全不一样呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0204_1009_p", "source_sha256": "601ed0b5a7c1a1163f3db4c42efca548cc000e42a984d27dcc82ee1275ae40db", "ja": "まあ衣装でもあるからな。アイドルとしての\nたまきの魅力が、引き立つようにはしてあるよ。", "zh": "毕竟也是演出服嘛。为了更好地衬托出环作为偶像的魅力，特意设计成这样的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0204_1010_040tam", "source_sha256": "0fe1f8a5dc7274647c632d5bef95407bfa18607e19b1f921b288299af3e51e87", "ja": "アイドルとしての、たまきの魅力……？\nそれって……じょしりょく？", "zh": "作为偶像的环魅力……？\n那就是……女子力？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0204_1011_p", "source_sha256": "243642f7cf0d60bf589c17d1cdb263bcbcaf2df3fd4c16e822729ef51614cbf7", "ja": "女子力も大事だとは思うけど、今回は違うかな。\n健康的な魅力を出していきたいと思ってるよ。", "zh": "女子力固然很重要，不过这次不太一样吧。\n我希望能展现出健康阳光的魅力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0204_1012_040tam", "source_sha256": "dc07033dbc2bc33cb87f8843bb376fde6c5ba21a763f57c09978db6e080a2edd", "ja": "健康的？　えーっと……うー、よくわかんないぞ～。\nたまきはどうしたらいいの？", "zh": "健康的？呃……唔，我不太明白啦～  \n环要怎么做才好？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0204_1013_p", "source_sha256": "c7b1d8643ffcf14653b8b5fefcad5353b9411cac165fa24f10126ba615ae0d50", "ja": "ああごめん、環は気にしなくていいよ。その衣装で\nただ楽しんでくれたら、それだけでいいんだ。", "zh": "啊，抱歉，环不用在意。穿着那身服装，尽情享受就好，这样就够了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0204_1014_040tam", "source_sha256": "d3d53e05d55bf6f16b026c2d9215bf338b64ee05e70e91717fa55989f78a1b8b", "ja": "楽しむだけでいいの！？\nたまき、それならすっごく得意！", "zh": "只要享受就可以了！？  \n环最擅长这个了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0204_1015_040tam", "source_sha256": "ebc4cbe4a8ea761bbb0818d5387d533f1d684a92a4a9e3047cf6b2d99d513341", "ja": "レッスンも公演も、劇場だったら\n毎日すっごく楽しいよ！　それだけでいいの？", "zh": "不管是训练还是演出，只要是在剧场，每天都会超级开心哦！这样就够了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0204_1016_p", "source_sha256": "bdd08cf3cde95335ef22048de6e4b6cfa6c0f34a9e5b26c34bf61fc515c36651", "ja": "うん、環らしく楽しんでくれたらいい。\nそうすれば自然と、魅力も出てくるはずだから。", "zh": "嗯，只要环能尽情享受就好。\n只要这样，魅力自然就会展现出来的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0204_1017_040tam", "source_sha256": "28f3fd68bc7ccea50bb7a5b4c0831a3ce34847ffcc23c04985f50ba61015b9fe", "ja": "そっか！　楽しむだけで魅力が出るなんて、\nこの衣装ってすごいね！", "zh": "这样啊！光是享受其中就能展现魅力，\n这套服装真厉害啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0204_1018_040tam", "source_sha256": "1522228956a87183da10ea22f123f978375c6178566cff139b7276756fe8cd16", "ja": "それじゃーたまき、いーっぱい楽しんじゃうぞ～！\nこの衣装で虫取りとか、探検とかするんだ～。", "zh": "那玉玉就尽情享受吧～！\n要穿着这身服装去捉虫、探险什么的～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0204_1019_040tam", "source_sha256": "3ce87392a2c545423da67e57e6a3d8159fc479b9b23efa6232306f586cfbde24", "ja": "そうだ！　今から公園に行こうよ！\nおやぶんが一緒なら、すっごく楽しいぞ～、くふふ♪", "zh": "对了！现在去公园吧！老大一起去的话，一定会超级开心的哦～，嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0204_1020_p", "source_sha256": "e3afdfff1224abbe9720742a05d6ecd1be36b129fb40d09bdd3b4f7ea1bc6e3f", "ja": "あっ、環！？　楽しんでくれって言っても、\nそれは衣装だから、仕事の話で……おーい、環～！", "zh": "啊，环！？虽然我说过希望你能乐在其中，\n但那是演出服装，是工作上的事……喂——，环～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
